    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the goal of a modern justice system is to uphold these human rights and values, wouldn't the only logical conclusion be to phase out retributive models in favor of restorative ones? it seems like sticking to retribution is just holding back social progress.",
